  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5597,
      "text": "a spring from which Allah’s slaves will drink, which will flow as they wish.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 579,
      "ruku": 514,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5598,
      "text": "They fulfill their vows and fear a Day whose evil will spread far and wide,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 579,
      "ruku": 514,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5599,
      "text": "and they give food, despite their love for it[4], to the needy, the orphans, and the captives,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 579,
      "ruku": 514,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5600,
      "text": "[saying to themselves] “We feed you only for the sake of Allah; we seek from you neither reward nor gratitude.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 579,
      "ruku": 514,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5601,
      "text": "We fear from our Lord a grim and distressful Day.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 579,
      "ruku": 514,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5602,
      "text": "So Allah will protect them from the evil of that Day, and will grant them radiance and delight,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 579,
      "ruku": 514,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5603,
      "text": "and will reward them for their perseverance with Paradise and garments of silk.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 579,
      "ruku": 514,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5604,
      "text": "They will recline therein on adorned couches; neither feeling scorching heat[5] nor freezing cold.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 579,
      "ruku": 514,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5605,
      "text": "with shady branches spread above them, and clusters of fruit will be made within their reach.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 579,
      "ruku": 514,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5606,
      "text": "They will be served frequently with silver vessels and crystal cups,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 579,
      "ruku": 514,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5607,
      "text": "crystalline goblets of silver, filled precisely as desired.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 579,
      "ruku": 514,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5608,
      "text": "They will be given a glass [of wine] flavored with ginger",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 579,
      "ruku": 514,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5609,
      "text": "from a spring therein called Salsabīl.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 579,
      "ruku": 514,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5610,
      "text": "They will be served by eternal young boys; if you see them, you would think that they are scattered pearls.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 579,
      "ruku": 514,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5611,
      "text": "If you were to look around, you would see bliss and a vast dominion.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 579,
      "ruku": 514,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5612,
      "text": "They will be dressed in garments of fine green silk and rich brocade, and will be adorned with bracelets of silver, and their Lord will give them a pure drink.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 579,
      "ruku": 514,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5613,
      "text": "[And they will be told,] “Indeed, this is your reward, and your efforts have been appreciated.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 579,
      "ruku": 514,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5614,
      "text": "Indeed, it is We Who have sent down the Qur’an to you in stages.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 579,
      "ruku": 515,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5615,
      "text": "So be patient with your Lord’s decree, and do not obey any sinner or disbeliever from among them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 579,
      "ruku": 515,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5616,
      "text": "And remember the Name of your Lord morning and evening[6],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
